//
// ISPF table services.  Tables are kept in memory and saved as JSON files in the table output library.
//
// Return codes follow ISPF: 0 OK, 4 (duplicate/replaced...), 8 not found / end, 12 table in use / not open,
// 16 table library error, 20 severe error.
