//                          D delete the whole block
//   TS[n] split the line at the cursor   TF[n] text flow of the paragraph (to column n)   TE text entry
//   COLS ruler line, MASK insert mask line, BNDS bounds line, TABS tabs line (temporary lines, never saved)
//   MD[n] make COLS lines data lines   TE[n] text entry with n lines
//   .label  assign a label to the line (.ZFIRST, .ZLAST are predefined)
//   Bounds (BNDS) apply to shifts, overlay, UC/LC, FIND, CHANGE and EXCLUDE.
