//   FIND|F    string [NEXT|PREV|FIRST|LAST|ALL] [CHARS|WORD|PREFIX|SUFFIX] [col1 [col2]] [X|NX] [.lab1 .lab2]
//   CHANGE|C  str1 str2 [same operands]          RFIND (F5), RCHANGE (F6)
//   EXCLUDE|EX|X [string] [ALL ...same operands]    (X ALL alone excludes every line)
//   FLIP [.lab1 .lab2]                            invert the excluded status
