//   RESET|RES [EXCLUDED|X] [LABEL|LAB] [COMMAND]   (no operand: everything except labels)
//   LOCATE|L line|.label, SAVE, END (F3), CANCEL|CAN, UNDO, REDO, CAPS ON|OFF, TOP, BOTTOM
//   SORT [A|D] [X|NX] [col1 [col2]] [.lab1 .lab2]
//   COPY|MOVE file [AFTER|BEFORE .label]   CREATE|REPLACE file [.lab1 .lab2]
//   Edit profile (saved by name, default = file extension):  PROFILE [name|LOCK|UNLOCK], HILITE ON|OFF|AUTO|lang,
//   HEX ON|OFF, BOUNDS [l r], AUTOSAVE ON|OFF, NUMBER ON|OFF [STD] [COBOL], RENUM, UNNUM, AUTONUM ON|OFF,
